    "number": 18,
    "summary": "Bildad tells of the damned state of the wicked who know not God.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 18:1",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "How long will it be ere ye make an end of words? mark, and afterwards we will speak.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 23
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 18:2",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Wherefore are we counted as beasts, and reputed vile in your sight?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 39
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 18:3",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "He teareth himself in his anger: shall the earth be forsaken for thee? and shall the rock be removed out of his place?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 18:4",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, the light of the wicked shall be put out, and the spark of his fire shall not shine.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "Prov. 13:9; 20:20; 24:20."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Prov. 13:9; 20:20; 24:20.",
            "prettyString": "Proverbs 13:9; 20:20; 24:20",
            "references": [
              {
